{
  "projects": {
    "default": "demo-linyup",
    "sandbox": "linyup-sandbox",
    "staging": "linyup-staging",
    "production": "linyup-prod"
  },
  "_comment_targets": [
    "Three real Firebase Hosting targets:",
    "- `landing`: apps/landing, the static marketing site (linyup.com).",
    "- `api`: the public API + MCP server (docs/public-api.md), every path rewritten",
    "  to the gen2 `api` function. Mapped in every environment; the deploy workflows",
    "  name it explicitly (hosting:api) alongside hosting:landing. The obvious name",
    "  linyup-staging-api is gone: a deleted site ID is reserved forever.",
    "- `help`: apps/help, the public product docs (help.linyup.com, help-stg.linyup.com",
    "  on staging). Staging and prod only; sandbox has none.",
    "",
    "There used to be an `app` target here too, pointing at the {project} sites",
    "(linyup-staging.web.app and friends). It predates the web app moving to App",
    "Hosting and was never removed: firebase.json had no `app` config and no",
    "workflow deployed hosting:app, so those sites were provisioned-but-empty and",
    "served a bare 404 to anything pointing at them — which is exactly what",
    "staging's HOSTING_URL did until 2026-08-14. The web apps live on App",
    "Hosting: app.linyup.com, app-stg.linyup.com, demo.linyup.com.",
    "",
    "`firebase target:apply` rewrites this file and DROPS this key — restore it."
  ],
  "targets": {
    "linyup-sandbox": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-sandbox-landing"
        ],
        "api": [
          "linyup-api-sandbox"
        ]
      }
    },
    "linyup-staging": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-staging-landing"
        ],
        "help": [
          "linyup-help-staging"
        ],
        "api": [
          "linyup-api-staging"
        ]
      }
    },
    "linyup-prod": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-prod-landing"
        ],
        "help": [
          "linyup-help-prod"
        ],
        "api": [
          "linyup-api-prod"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "etags": {}
}
